    "name": "SAT Datashare \u2014 8 GETs (Exp / PAPI / SAPI)",
    "description": "Eight datashare GET endpoints for all three APIs.\n\nExp: clients never send database or supplier.\n- Invoice, Order, Customer: fromDate, toDate, pageNumber\n- Product, Route, SalesRep, Warehouse: no query params\n- Stock: pageNumber only\n\nPAPI and SAPI: always send database and supplier.\nInvoice, Order, Customer also send fromDate and toDate.\nProduct, Route, SalesRep, Stock, Warehouse send pageNumber only (plus database/supplier).\n\nDates are YYYY-MM-DD. pageNumber is 0-based. Follow payload.next until it is omitted.\nFor localhost, set *_base to http://localhost:8081.",
